-- The Line Breaking Algorithm of Unicode Standard Annex #14, as the crate
-- drives it in `src/lib.rs`: the pair table in `Tables.mw` is the whole state
-- machine, and this steps through it.
--
-- As in the crate, Complex-Context Dependent characters (SA: Thai, Lao, ...)
-- are treated as ordinary alphabetic ones, so no break is found inside a word
-- of those scripts.
--
